BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:skiathos-skiathos-town-feast-of-the-finding-of-the-icon-of-panagia-ei-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270704
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270706
SUMMARY:Feast of the Finding of the Icon of Panagia Eikonistria\, Skiathos Town
LOCATION:Skiathos Town\, Skiathos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Skiathos' second feast of its patroness marks the finding of the icon in a pine tree in 1655. On the evening of 4 July the icon is carried from Treis Ierarches to the church of Genniseos tis Theotokou for vespers with several bishops\, and on the morning of the 5th\, after the liturgy\, it is processed through the streets of the Chora. Pilgrims come from the mainland\, so the town churches are packed\; it is a religious event with no glenti attached.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/skiathos/#skiathos-town-feast-of-the-finding-of-the-icon-of-panagia-ei
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/skiathos/#skiathos-town-feast-of-the-finding-of-the-icon-of-panagia-ei
END:VEVENT
