BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:skiathos-platanias-agia-paraskevi-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-platania-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270725
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270727
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agia Paraskevi\, Platanias
LOCATION:Platanias (Agia Paraskevi)\, Skiathos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The municipality's main summer panigiri: vespers at 8 pm on 25 July at the chapel of Agia Paraskevi behind Platanias beach\, then from about 9 pm a live nisiotika orchestra\, dancing and food and drink in the churchyard until late. The 2026 edition was run by the Dimos Skiathou with free entry. It is on the main road to Koukounaries\, so take the bus from town rather than fighting for parking.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/skiathos/#platanias-agia-paraskevi-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-platania
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/skiathos/#platanias-agia-paraskevi-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-platania
END:VEVENT
